-                            "draining the queue (waits only for the fence that last read the range); vertex, "
-                            "vertex-constant and upload rings still drain (patch 2153)\n");
+                            "draining the queue (waits for a covering fence); vertex, "
+                            "vertex-constant and upload rings still drain (patches 2153+2155; conservative live prefixes)\n");
     }
     return on;
 }
